{"type":"jsonTeamEventDetail","id":1677354,"mrUssMeetId":0,"touchpadLiveId":0,"categoryIds":[],"categoryId":0,"categoryName":"Uncategorized","eventTitle":"2026 IE IES Junior Championships * NEW LOCATION & HOST *","meetName":"","meetType":"","location":"Gibb Pool/WSU Campus - Pullman, WA 99164","onsiteLocation":false,"locationId":0,"locationAddress":"Gibb Pool/WSU Campus - Pullman, WA 99164","teams":[],"fees":{},"eventDescription":"<p>***Zipped Results File &amp; PDFs are posted below***</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">UPDATE 02/07/26&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">Coaches,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">Due to a sudden mechanical failure, the Moses Lake Pool is no longer available to host the upcoming, Junior Championship Meet</span>. The IES Technical Planning Committee has met and reviewed available options so that we can still offer this meet on February 13th-15th. &nbsp;The request was made of <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">Cougar Aquatics</span> and they <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\">have agreed to host the meet at Gibb Pool at WSU</span>, despite&nbsp;<u>extremely</u>&nbsp;short notice.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">Teams will be allowed to update their entries with&nbsp;<u>no</u>&nbsp;penalty.&nbsp;<b><u><font color=\"#ff2600\">The deadline for sending in your new Jr Champs entries is Monday, February 9th at 9pm.</font></u></b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">A revised Meet Announcement is posted below.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">The Coaches Zoom Meeting will be held Tuesday, February 10th @ 7:30 pm. Please contace me or the IES Office <a href=\"mailto:iesoffice@ieswim.org\">iesoffice@ieswim.org</a> for the meeting link.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">Thank you for your understanding and flexibility given this very challenging circumstance. &nbsp;If you have any questions, please don&#39;t hesitate to contact me.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">Tia Pollick</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">Championship Coordinator</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\"><a href=\"mailto:swimofficemom@gmail.com\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\" target=\"_blank\">swimofficemom@gmail.com</a></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">509-554-3298</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>","eventAddress":"Gibb Pool/WSU Campus - Pullman, WA 99164","startDateTimeDisplay":"02/13/2026 12:00:00 AM","s